    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202780/extras/5f3a5796b1a3d38ed2f768cc0d607b40.poster.avif?t=1647949738\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202780/extras/5f3a5796b1a3d38ed2f768cc0d607b40.webm?t=1647949738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Join Theme Park Simulator</strong></h2><br>Come and discover the amusement park that already reaches <strong>more than 500,000 downloads.</strong><br><br>Are you ready to be a real amusement park operator? If you like simulation games and theme parks, pay attention! Because in Theme Park Simulator you can enjoy taking control of the most famous attractions.  <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202780/extras/1dcfb11dc5b09fc1f813bd905c7e2775.poster.avif?t=1647949738\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202780/extras/1dcfb11dc5b09fc1f813bd905c7e2775.webm?t=1647949738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Play with <strong>passengers.</strong></li><li><strong>Up to 7 cinematic cameras</strong>, enjoy the <strong>on ride</strong> and <strong>off ride</strong> experience.</li><li><strong>Realistic graphics and controls</strong>.</li><li> <strong>Light and FX control</strong></li><li>Vision <strong>day</strong> and  <strong>night.</strong></li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202780/extras/8e5f1740e84fff77e1219c32726684c2.